{"id":"655096","name":"豆沙柿子饼","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/655096/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"柿子","amount":"160g"},{"name":"糯米粉","amount":"120g"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"40g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：柿子、糯米粉、面粉。","img":"images/655096/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"柿子去皮去核，在料理机中打成泥(160g)。","img":"images/655096/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入糯米粉和面粉。","img":"images/655096/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"和成光滑面团，盖盖饧发半个小时。","img":"images/655096/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"核桃豆沙分成小份。","img":"images/655096/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"饧发好的面团揉搓成长条，均匀切小份。","img":"images/655096/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压扁，放入豆沙馅，收好口。","img":"images/655096/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"全部做好。","img":"images/655096/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"压扁，撒上芝麻。","img":"images/655096/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"平底锅放油，放入柿子饼煎制。","img":"images/655096/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"翻面继续煎熟。","img":"images/655096/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"香甜软糯。","img":"images/655096/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}